source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A closing candidate whose first `?` a backslash precedes is skipped rather than accepted, so Jira closes on the later `??`; jiro has no citation inline and keeps the source characters.
-- input.jira --
??ab\?? c??
-- rendered.html --
<p><cite>ab&#63;? c</cite></p>
-- want.md --
??ab?? c??
-- warnings.json --
[]
